  "text": "The program focuses on cyclone and cyclone-related flood risks, providing transparent and periodic public reporting. It emphasizes the assessment of pass-through savings to consumers and involves multi-year tracking of market outcomes. The ACCC's independence enhances the credibility of the program, which is aligned with a specific policy intervention to improve insurance affordability and availability in high-risk areas.",
